		bailey (thinking): Should I play Duolingo?
		- Yes
			[signal arg="play_duolingo"]
		- No
			bailey (default): maybe later
	
	elif {SMOKE_FED} == true:
		Turn on the computer?
		- Maybe I can find a clue somewhere on this machine
			bailey (thinking): ...some of the text scribbled on that crumpled note I found sure looked \
			like that of a [b][color=blue]web page URL[/color][/b]
			bailey (thinking): I guess I should open Firefox on my [b][color=gold]husbands computer[/color][/b] and try typing it into the address bar...
		- Not right now
			bailey (default): I'll come back later...

else:
	bailey (default): My husband [b]loves[/b] playing on his [b][color=gold]computer[/color][/b].
	bailey (exhausted): Aw man... I thought for sure I'd find him here!